Call on every app startup to check for updates.

**Response:**
```json
{
  "data": {
    "updateAvailable": true,
    "forceUpdate": false,
    "latestVersion": "1.2.0",
    "storeUrl": "https://play.google.com/..."
  }
}
```

If `forceUpdate: true` → show mandatory update dialog.

